<Pathway xmlns="http://pathvisio.org/GPML/2013a" Name="Thyroid hormone catabolism via hepatic nuclear receptors leading to neurodevelopmental defects" Data-Source="WikiPathways" Version="WP5729_r20260831120000" Author="[Marvin M2, SidraAdil]" Last-Modified="20260831120000" Organism="Homo sapiens">
  <Comment Source="WikiPathways-description">Molecular Adverse Outcome Pathway for [AOP 8](https://identifiers.org/aop/8), "Upregulation of Thyroid Hormone Catabolism via Activation of Hepatic Nuclear Receptors, and Subsequent Adverse Neurodevelopmental Outcomes in Mammals". Key Event nodes and the relationships between them are from AOP-Wiki RDF 97191db (2026-08-01); the green pathway nodes are the molecular pathways mapped to each Key Event and approved in the molAOP Builder (snapshot 2026-08-13). The source AOP was developed in a non-human species; the mapped molecular pathways are human.</Comment>
